// Application icon resource — sets the .exe's icon shown in Explorer,
// taskbar, and Alt-Tab.  The .ico is multi-size (256/48/32/16) so Windows
// picks the right size per context.  The window title-bar icon is set
// separately at runtime via SetIcon() (loads app256.png beside the exe).
//
// ID 1 = the app icon; Windows uses the lowest-numbered ICON resource as
// the exe's default icon.
1 ICON "resources/app.ico"
